Thought: The IR spectra provide information about the functional groups present in the molecule. The presence of peaks around 3407 cm-1 suggests O-H or N-H stretching, while peaks around 3030-3100 cm-1 indicate C-H stretching in aromatic compounds. Peaks around 2221 cm-1 suggest a nitrile group (C≡N). I will now use mass spectrometry to gather information about the molecular weight and possible fragments of the compound.
