Thought: The SMILES string "CC1C=CC(=CC1=[N+]=[N-])C" is also valid. This structure contains a pyridine ring with a nitro group, which could also align with the IR data. I will validate the next SMILES string to continue exploring all possibilities.
Action: validate_smiles
Action Input: {"smiles": "C1C=CNCC2=CC=CN21"}

Thought: The SMILES string "C1C=CNCC2=CC=CN21" is valid. This structure represents a bicyclic compound with two nitrogen atoms, which could also fit the IR and mass spectrometry data. I will validate the next SMILES string to ensure all potential structures are considered.
