Action Input: {"smiles": "CCN1C=CN=C1CC#C"}

Thought: The SMILES string "CCN1C=CN=C1CC#C" is valid. This structure includes a pyridine ring and an alkyne group, which could also align with the IR data. I will validate the final SMILES string to complete the evaluation of all possible isomers.
